<PageLayout
  title="Thank you — TotalRecalls"
  description="Your TotalRecalls purchase is confirmed. Your license key is on its way by email."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Thanks" }]}
  robots="noindex, follow"
>
  <h1>Thank you!</h1>
  <p>Your Paddle purchase was received. Your license key is on its way to your email — enter it in TotalRecalls (top-right &ldquo;Pro&rdquo; badge &rarr; paste the key &rarr; Activate) to unlock all 8 providers and unlimited downloads.</p>
  <p>Your receipt and invoice were emailed by Paddle. You can re-download the app any time from the <a href="/download/">download page</a>.</p>
  <p>Key not arrived after a few minutes? Check your spam folder, then <a href="/support/">contact support</a> — we can look it up by your order.</p>
</PageLayout>
